OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMainly dry
OL,6,Fbecoming cloudy at times especially
OL,7,Falong the coast where scattered
OL,8,Fshowers may push inland. Becoming
OL,9,Fchilly, with light winds and frost
OL,10,Fpatches possible.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FSome sunny spells, especially
OL,13,Fat first, but cloud increases and
OL,14,Fscattered showers continue for a while
OL,15,Falong and near the coast. Later most
OL,16,Fshowers die away and cloud breaks
OL,17,Fdevelop.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
